  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH42C15379C637EA3435E46833EB335ACE" xlink:label="HH42C15379C637EA3435E46833EB335ACE" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHB7A87FF3789A99B98ED4985E103A5941" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>Management believes that the information on this page has been prepared in accordance with the&#160;Commission's Opinion 154-B methodology, except as noted below. This presentation on page 700 is not necessarily in the&#160;form in which it would appear in connection with a challenge to a particular rate, or rates, and is&#160;therefore not intended to be binding in any specific rate litigation.</p>
        <p>
          <strong>Notes:</strong>
        </p>
        <p>Totals may not sum due to rounding.</p>
        <p>The Page 700 of Enbridge Energy, Limited Partnership's (Enbridge Energy's) 2025 Form No. 6 reflects the provisions of the Enbridge Energy Offer of Settlement and Settlement Agreement (Agreement) (FERC Docket Nos. IS21-352-000 and DO21-15-000) which was approved by the FERC in a letter order issued November 27, 2023. In accordance with the provisions of the Agreement, Management has impremented new depreciation rates as of January 1, 2021, deemed zero percent inflation in calculating the rate of return on the real cost of Stakeholders' Equity as of July 1, 2021, and subsequently ceased adding any deferred earnings to the deferred earnings balance as of July 1, 2021.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
